First, divide 300 by 6, which equals 50. Then divide the remaining 18 by 6, which equals 3. Adding these results together, 50 + 3 = 53. Alternatively, performing the long division $318 \div 6$ directly gives 53. Therefore, you want to give 53 cookies to each person.

